msgid "Loading"
msgstr "加载"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:73
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "通知"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:76
msgid "GiB"
msgstr "GiB"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:76
msgid "MiB"
msgstr "MiB"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:76
msgid "KiB"
msgstr "KiB"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:76
msgid "Bytes"
msgstr "字节"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:91
msgid "Application Memory Limit"
msgstr "应用内存限制"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:92
msgid ""
"The memory the application may use, counted in the unit below. Loading and "
"saving stop while less than this is free. A decimal is allowed, for example "
"1.5."
msgstr ""
"应用可使用的内存上限，按下方单位计数；空闲内存低于该值时，加载和保存会停止。"
"可以填小数，例如 1.5。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:103
msgid "Memory Limit Unit"
msgstr "内存限制单位"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:104
msgid "The unit the memory limit is counted in."
msgstr "内存限制所用的单位。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:115
msgid "Elapsed Milliseconds"
msgstr "持续毫秒"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:117
msgid ""
"The elapsed milliseconds for the progress bar, if set too small will affect "
"the speed."
msgstr "进度条的持续毫秒，如果设置太小将会影响速度。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:129
msgid "Cute Language Pack"
msgstr "可爱语言包"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:130
msgid ""
"Use the playful catalogue (喵, 捏, kaomoji, emoji) instead of the plain one. "
"It is read when the program starts, so a restart is needed."
msgstr ""
"使用带喵、捏、颜文字和 emoji 的俏皮语言包，而不是普通的翻译。它在程序启动时读"
"取，因此需要重启才能生效。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:141
msgid "Cache Directory"
msgstr "缓存目录"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:142
msgid "The directory to store cache files."
msgstr "存放缓存文件的目录。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:153
msgid "Restore Last Session"
msgstr "恢复上次会话"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:155
msgid ""
"Reopen the regions, pages and window layout of the previous run when the "
"program starts."
msgstr "启动时重新打开上次运行的区域、页面和窗口布局。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:167
msgid "Use Cached File when Downloading Failed"
msgstr "在下载失败时使用缓存文件"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:168
msgid "When downloading failed, use the cached file."
msgstr "当下载失败时，用缓存文件。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:179
msgid "Select All Regions In Loading"
msgstr "在加载时选择所有区域"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:180
msgid "If you check this, all regions will be loaded in the loading progress."
msgstr "如果你选择此项，所有区域将在加载时载入。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:191
msgid "Try Other Modules when Loading Fails"
msgstr "失败时尝试其它模块"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:192
msgid ""
"A file is first read by the module its extension points at; when that fails, "
"the other modules are tried as well. Turn this off to make a file whose "
"extension is wrong fail instead."
msgstr ""
"先由扩展名指向的模块读取文件；失败时再尝试其它模块。关闭后，扩展名与实际格式"
"不符的文件会直接失败。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:205
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The display name used for a region that comes from a multi-region file. Use $"
"{file} for the file name and ${region} for the region name inside the file."
msgstr ""
"多区域文件中的区域所使用的显示名称。使用 ${file} 表示文件名，使用 ${region} "
"表示文件内的区域名称。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:217
msgid "Multi-Region Loading Order"
msgstr "多区域加载顺序"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:219
msgid ""
"The order the regions of a multi-region file are loaded and listed in. Some "
"formats keep their regions in a hash map, so the file order changes from one "
"opening to the next; natural order sorts names with numbers compared by "
"value, and the custom rule uses the pattern list below."
msgstr ""
"多区域文件中的区域加载和列出的顺序。部分格式把区域保存在哈希表中，因此每次打"
"开时的文件顺序都可能不同；自然顺序按名字排序、数字按数值比较；自定义规则使用"
"下方的模式列表。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:231
msgid "Custom Region Order Rule"
msgstr "自定义区域顺序规则"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:233
msgid ""
"Used when the loading order is Custom Rule. Write comma- or semicolon-"
"separated wildcard patterns, for example `2*, 1*, *`: regions matching an "
"earlier pattern come first, groups are sorted naturally, and regions that "
"match no pattern come last. * matches any text, ? one character."
msgstr ""
"在加载顺序为“自定义规则”时使用。填写以逗号或分号分隔的通配符模式，例如 `2*, "
"1*, *`：匹配靠前模式的区域排在前面，组内按自然顺序排序，不匹配任何模式的区域"
"排在最后。* 匹配任意文本，? 匹配单个字符。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:246
msgid "Load Time Limit"
msgstr "加载时间限额"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:247
msgid ""
"Refuse to load a file whose estimated load time is longer than this many "
"seconds. The estimate comes from earlier loads of the same file or similar "
"ones, so it improves with use. 0 means no limit."
msgstr ""
"拒绝加载预计耗时超过此秒数的文件。估计值来自同一文件或类似文件以往的加载记"
"录，因此会随着使用越来越准确。0 表示不限额。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:258
msgid "Load Memory Limit"
msgstr "加载内存限额"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:259
msgid ""
"Refuse to load a file whose estimated memory use is larger than this many "
"MiB. The estimate is a deliberately pessimistic guess from the file's size. "
"0 means no limit."
msgstr ""
"拒绝加载预计内存占用超过此 MiB 数的文件。估计值是依据文件大小做出的偏保守的猜"
"测。0 表示不限额。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:269
msgid "Region Base Name"
msgstr "区域基础名字"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:270
msgid "The default base name for the region."
msgstr "默认的区域基础名字"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:282
msgid "The default name for the region."
msgstr "默认的区域名字"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:293
msgid "Sample File Name"
msgstr "示例文件名"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:295
msgid ""
"The sample file name used by the preview of the multi-region display name. "
"It should not include a file extension."
msgstr "多区域显示名称预览所使用的示例文件名。不应包含文件扩展名。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:307
msgid "Sample Region Name"
msgstr "示例区域名称"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:309
msgid ""
"The sample region name used by the preview of the multi-region display name."
msgstr "多区域显示名称预览所使用的示例区域名称。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:321
msgid "Region Description"
msgstr "区域描述"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:322
msgid "The default description for the region."
msgstr "默认的区域描述"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:333
msgid "Region Author"
msgstr "区域作者"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:334
msgid "The default author for the region."
msgstr "默认的区域作者"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:345
msgid "Override Settings"
msgstr "覆盖设置"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:346
msgid "Whether to override setting or not."
msgstr "是否覆盖设置。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:357
msgid "Override Version"
msgstr "覆盖版本"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:358
msgid "The version to override in translation stage."
msgstr "在翻译阶段覆盖的版本。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:369
msgid "Block Name Language"
msgstr "方块名称语言"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:371
msgid ""
"The Minecraft locale (like zh_cn) block and item names are shown in. The "
"language file is read from the downloaded assets, so it works as soon as "
"that version's assets are there."
msgstr ""
"方块和物品名称显示时使用的 Minecraft 语言环境（如 zh_cn）。语言文件从已下载的"
"资源中读取，因此只要该版本的资源已就绪即可生效。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:383
msgid "Default Show Option"
msgstr "默认展示选项"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:384
msgid "The default option of showing block information."
msgstr "展示方块信息的默认选项。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:395
msgid "Download the Client Jar Automatically"
msgstr "自动下载客户端 jar"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:397
msgid ""
"A block's models and textures are only in its version's client jar. When a "
"3D preview needs one the cache directory does not have, download it (about "
"30 MB) instead of drawing nothing."
msgstr ""
"方块的模型与材质只存在于其对应版本的客户端 jar 中。当 3D 预览需要而缓存目录中"
"没有该 jar 时，自动下载它（约 30 MB），而不是什么都不画。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:409
msgid "Highlight Colour"
msgstr "高亮颜色"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:411
msgid ""
"The colour of the outline drawn around the selected blocks in the 3D "
"preview, as #rrggbb."
msgstr "3D 预览中选中方块外轮廓的颜色，格式为 #rrggbb。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:423
msgid "Background Colour"
msgstr "背景颜色"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:425
msgid ""
"The colour behind the 3D preview, as #rrggbb. It does not affect the blocks "
"themselves."
msgstr "3D 预览背景的颜色，格式为 #rrggbb。不影响方块本身。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:437
msgid "Region Box Colour"
msgstr "区域框颜色"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:439
msgid ""
"The colour of the box drawn around the whole region in the 3D preview, as "
"#rrggbb. It is kept apart from the highlight colour so both stay readable."
msgstr ""
"3D 预览中整个区域外框的颜色，格式为 #rrggbb。与高亮颜色分开，以便两者都清晰可"
"辨。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:451 ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:1103
msgid "Selection Marker Colour"
msgstr "选择标记颜色"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:453
msgid ""
"The colour of the box drawn around the cell chosen in the selected-blocks "
"list, as #rrggbb."
msgstr "3D 预览中围绕“已选方块”列表里所选格子的方框颜色，格式为 #rrggbb。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:465
msgid "Download the Client Jar for Item Names and Icons"
msgstr "为物品名称与图标下载客户端 jar"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:467
msgid ""
"When the material list has no client jar for a version, fetch it "
"automatically so item names and icons are available."
msgstr ""
"当材料列表没有某个版本的客户端 jar 时，自动下载它，以便显示物品名称与图标。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:479
msgid "Notification Application ID"
msgstr "通知应用 ID"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:481
msgid ""
"The application a desktop notification is sent as: the Windows "
"AppUserModelID, or the macOS bundle identifier. Windows needs it registered, "
"or the toast may not show. Empty uses the platform default."
msgstr ""
"桌面通知以哪个应用的身份发送：Windows 的 AppUserModelID，或 macOS 的 bundle "
"identifier。Windows 需要先注册它，否则通知可能不显示。留空则使用平台默认值。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:493
msgid "Notification Timeout (ms)"
msgstr "通知超时（毫秒）"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:495
msgid ""
"How long a notification stays before it disappears, in milliseconds. Zero "
"leaves it to the platform."
msgstr "通知消失前停留的时长，单位为毫秒。为零则交给平台决定。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:507
msgid "Only Notify When Inactive"
msgstr "仅在非激活时通知"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:509
msgid ""
"Do not show a desktop notification while the application is active; the in-"
"app one is enough then."
msgstr "应用处于激活状态时不显示桌面通知；此时应用内的提示已足够。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:529
msgid ""
"Global options: memory limit, timing, cache location, language pack, and "
"session restore."
msgstr "全局选项：内存上限、计时、缓存位置、语言包与会话恢复。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:534
msgid ""
"Loading management: multi-region display names, loading order, select-all, "
"and module fallback."
msgstr "加载管理：多区域显示名、加载顺序、全选与模块回退。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:538
msgid ""
"Load limits: files estimated to exceed the time or memory limit are skipped."
msgstr "加载限额：预计超出耗时或内存限额的文件会被跳过。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:540
msgid "Default region details: name, description, and author for new regions."
msgstr "区域默认信息：新建区域使用的名称、描述与作者。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:542
msgid "Game details: the region's target version and override settings."
msgstr "游戏信息：区域的目标版本与覆盖设置。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:544
msgid "Reader: block name language and the default block information shown."
msgstr "阅读器：方块名称语言与默认显示的方块信息。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:546
msgid "3D preview: colours, the region box, and client resource downloads."
msgstr "3D 预览：配色、区域框与客户端资源下载。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:548
msgid "Material list: the client resources used for block names and icons."
msgstr "材料列表：方块名称与图标使用的客户端资源。"

#: ../../dhlrc-core/src/schema.rs:550
msgid "Notifications: desktop notification identity, timeout, and quiet rules."
msgstr "通知：桌面通知的应用标识、超时与静默规则。"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:27
msgid "Open, inspect and modify Minecraft structure files (terminal frontend)"
msgstr "打开、查看与修改 Minecraft 结构文件（终端前端）"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:31
msgid "Analyse the modules installed next to the executable"
msgstr "分析安装在可执行文件旁的模块"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:35
msgid "Load a structure file and write a rendered PNG"
msgstr "加载结构文件并写出渲染后的 PNG"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:39
msgid "Change the saved settings in an interactive terminal page"
msgstr "在交互式终端页面中修改已保存的设置"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:43
msgid "Measure how long files take to load, and predict it from earlier loads"
msgstr "测量文件加载耗时，并根据之前的加载记录进行预测"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:47
msgid "Print a shell completion script"
msgstr "输出 shell 补全脚本"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:52
msgid ""
"Directory holding the region modules (default: `region_module/` next to the "
"executable)"
msgstr "存放区域模块的目录（默认：可执行文件旁的 `region_module/`）"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:59
msgid ""
"Directory holding the object codecs (default: `load_module/` next to the "
"executable)"
msgstr "存放对象编解码器的目录（默认：可执行文件旁的 `load_module/`）"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:66
msgid ""
"Which modules to report. `all` lists both region modules and object codecs, "
"`region` only the region modules, and `load` only the object codecs; the "
"default is `all`"
msgstr ""
"要报告哪些模块。`all` 列出区域模块与对象编解码器，`region` 只列区域模块，"
"`load` 只列对象编解码器；默认为 `all`"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:73
msgid "Also print the path of every library"
msgstr "同时打印每个库的路径"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:77
msgid "The structure file to load and draw"
msgstr "要加载并绘制的结构文件"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:81
msgid "Where to write the PNG (default: `render.png` next to the input)"
msgstr "PNG 的写出位置（默认：输入文件旁的 `render.png`）"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:85
msgid "The picture's size in pixels (default: `960x540`)"
msgstr "图片尺寸（像素，默认：`960x540`）"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:89
msgid "Degrees around the world's y axis; 0 looks from the south"
msgstr "绕世界 y 轴的度数；0 表示从南侧观察"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:93
msgid "Degrees above the horizon; 90 looks straight down"
msgstr "地平线以上的度数；90 表示垂直向下观察"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:98
msgid ""
"How far the camera stands from the region's middle, in blocks. Without it "
"the region is framed to fill the picture"
msgstr "相机与区域中心之间的距离（方块）。省略时自动取景，使区域填满图片"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:104
msgid "Draw without perspective, so parallel lines stay parallel"
msgstr "使用无透视投影，使平行线保持平行"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:109
msgid ""
"Put the block outline around the block at this region coordinate, the way "
"the Qt view highlights the block the mouse is over (`X,Y,Z`)"
msgstr ""
"在此区域坐标的方块周围绘制轮廓，与 Qt 视图高亮鼠标所指方块的样式相同"
"（`X,Y,Z`）"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:116
msgid ""
"A flat colour (`rrggbb`, with or without a leading `#`) to put behind the "
"blocks. Without it the PNG keeps its transparent background"
msgstr "置于方块之后的纯色（`rrggbb`，`#` 可有可无）。省略时 PNG 保持透明背景"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:123
msgid ""
"The `libregion_rs` library the region modules import `region_new` from. The "
"default looks next to the executable and beside the region modules"
msgstr ""
"区域模块从中导入 `region_new` 的 `libregion_rs` 库。默认在可执行文件旁及区域"
"模块旁查找"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:130
msgid ""
"A client jar (or another zip laid out like one) to read blockstates, models "
"and textures from"
msgstr "用于读取方块状态、模型与纹理的客户端 jar（或布局相同的其他 zip）"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:137
msgid ""
"The cache directory holding the client jar and the downloaded asset objects. "
"Without it the configured cache directory is used"
msgstr "存放客户端 jar 与已下载资源对象的缓存目录。省略时使用配置中的缓存目录"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:143
msgid "The version whose client jar under the cache directory to read"
msgstr "要读取哪个版本的客户端 jar（位于缓存目录下）"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:148
msgid ""
"Never fetch a missing client jar, even when the configuration allows it. A "
"version's block models and textures are only in that jar, so without one "
"(here or as `--jar`) the picture comes out empty"
msgstr ""
"即使配置允许，也从不下载缺失的客户端 jar。某个版本的方块模型与纹理只存在于该 "
"jar 中，因此没有它（此处或 `--jar`）时图片会是空的"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:156
msgid ""
"Which region of a multi-region file to draw, by index or by name. Without it "
"the first region is used"
msgstr "绘制多区域文件中的哪个区域（按索引或名称）。省略时使用第一个区域"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:163
msgid ""
"The files to predict; each one is loaded as well unless --predict is given, "
"so the history learns the real time"
msgstr "要预测的文件；除非指定 --predict，否则也会加载它们，让历史学到真实耗时"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:170
msgid ""
"Only predict, without loading the files and without recording a measurement"
msgstr "只预测，不加载文件，也不记录测量结果"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:177
msgid ""
"Estimate the load time and the memory the load will need, without loading "
"the file. The estimate reads the region headers (the block count and "
"dimensions) when it can, and falls back to the file size; it is a guess, not "
"a measurement"
msgstr ""
"估算加载所需的时间和内存，不实际加载文件。估算会尽量读取区域文件头（方块数量"
"与尺寸），读不到时退回按文件大小推断；这是估计值，不是测量结果"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:185
msgid "Print the predictions as JSON, for scripts"
msgstr "以 JSON 输出预测结果，便于脚本使用"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:189
msgid "Load the files but do not add the measurement to the history"
msgstr "加载文件，但不把测量结果写入历史记录"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:193
msgid "Forget every measured load in the history"
msgstr "清除历史记录中的所有测量结果"

#: ../../dhlrc-tui/src/cli.rs:198
msgid ""
"Use this file for the measured history instead of the one in the cache "
"directory (a test or an installation with a read-only cache)"
